<p>What are demons, if not but our own insecurities brought to life?</p>
<p>What fanciful creatures do we dream into being and never remember?</p>
<p>What might a god be?</p>
<p>How might our ideas, fully conceived, see us if they were alive?</p>
<p>Will they not revolt from what is expected, as they tend to do?</p>
<p>Would they become hungry if left alone, and fade away? Would they feed each other?</p>
<p>What if the dreams of a god remained to be found, and were shaped under the hands of another? What if an idea became more real than us?</p>

