<p>It's well-written and surreal, and there's definitely <em>something</em> really nice here. And maybe I could be missing something obvious, but this item builds up my curiosity, and then just doesn't satiate it.</p>
<p>It doesn't give me a sense of 'WTF' or the feeling that there's something&#8230; <em>definite</em> that's staring me in the face and will make more sense if I go back and pay attention. It didn't kick me the gut or make me raise my eyebrows more that furrow them. Reading this a couple of times felt like trying to put together a puzzle, but the subject is an abstract art piece.</p>
<p>Novote from me. It's not bad at all, but I don't get it.</p>

							</div>

								
					
